---
source: crates/ferry-cli/src/render.rs
expression: config_schema(&sample_schema())
---
peer.name
    a name without spaces or ':' (empty: the hostname); default (empty); applies after a restart of ferryd (systemctl --user restart ferryd)
    This machine's name
crossing.edge_resistance_px
    a whole number, 0 to 200 px; default 0; applies at once
    How far to push
crossing.escape_chord
    a key combination, such as Super+Ctrl+Escape; default Super+Ctrl+Escape; applies at once in ferryd; `ferry setup` updates the Hyprland bind
    The keys that give input back
input.capture
    one of auto, portal, off; default auto; applies after a restart of ferryd (systemctl --user restart ferryd)
    How input is captured
input.scroll_invert
    true or false; default false; applies after a restart of ferryd (systemctl --user restart ferryd)
    Invert scrolling
    Not available yet: it arrives in a later version.
